<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-ESTONIAN Q1 GDP UP 10.8 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-ESTONIAN Q1 GDP UP 10.8 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian first quarter GDP in</p>
<p>constant 1993 prices rose 10.8 percent versus the first quarter</p>
<p>of 1996 but fell 12.9 versus Q4 1996, the statistics office said</p>
<p>on Friday.</p>
</text>
